:#38bdf8;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\">Active Alerts</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#9ca3af;\">21 - Active Alerts</div></div><div style=\"padding:4px 0;margin:3px 0;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_22}}\" style=\"color:#38bdf8;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\">Resource Health</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#9ca3af;\">22 - Resource Health</div></div><div style=\"padding:4px 0;margin:3px 0;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_23}}\" style=\"color:#38bdf8;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\">Websites</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#9ca3af;\">23 - Websites and Services</div></div><div style=\"padding:4px 0;margin:3px 0;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_24}}\" style=\"color:#38bdf8;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\">Coverage</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#9ca3af;\">24 - Coverage, Capacity &amp; Licenses</div></div><div style=\"padding:4px 0;margin:3px 0;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_25}}\" style=\"color:#38bdf8;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\">Access</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#9ca3af;\">25 - Access and Administration</div></div></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:rgba(15,23,42,.76);border:1px solid rgba(191,219,254,.20);border-radius:12px;padding:13px;width:25%;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:5px 8px;margin-bottom:8px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(96,165,250,.18);border:1px solid rgba(191,219,254,.24);color:#fca5a5;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;\">Technical</span><div style=\"padding:4px 0;margin:3px 0;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_30}}\" style=\"color:#38bdf8;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\">Investigation</a><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#9ca3af;\">30 - Technical Resource Investigation</div></div><div style=\"padding:4px 0;margin:3px 0;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{DASHBOARD_ID_31}}\" style=\"color:#38bdf8;text-decora