        "content": "<div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#111827 0%,#172554 100%);color:#ffffff;border-radius:14px;padding:18px 20px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;\">Three dashboard groups</div>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:12px;\"><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:rgba(15,23,42,.72);border:1px solid rgba(191,219,254,.20);border-radius:12px;padding:13px;min-height:110px;width:25%;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:5px 8px;margin-bottom:8px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(96,165,250,.18);border:1px solid rgba(191,219,254,.24);color:#bfdbfe;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;\">Executive</span><div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;margin-bottom:8px;\">Leadership visibility</div><ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:16px;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;\"><li>Command Center health snapshot</li><li>Platform value and coverage</li><li>Capacity and service risk</li><li>Links to Operational detail</li></ul></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:rgba(15,23,42,.72);border:1px solid rgba(191,219,254,.20);border-radius:12px;padding:13px;min-height:110px;width:25%;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:5px 8px;margin-bottom:8px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(96,165,250,.18);border:1px solid rgba(191,219,254,.24);color:#bfdbfe;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;\">Operational</span><div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;margin-bottom:8px;\">Daily monitoring</div><ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:16px;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;\"><li>Active alert triage</li><li>Resource and website health</li><li>Coverage and licenses</li><li>Access administration</li></ul></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:rgba(15,23,42,.72);border:1px solid rgba(191,219,254,.20);border-radius:12px;padding:13px;min-height:110px;width:25%;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:5px 8px;margin-bottom:8px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(96,165,250,.18);border:1px solid rgba(191,219,254,.24);color:#bfdbfe;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;\">Technical</span><div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;margin-bottom:8px;\">Investigation</div><ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:16px;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;\"><li>Resource investigation hub</li><li>Collector diagnostics</li><li>LogicModule noise</li><li>OOTB technology directory</li></ul></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:rgba(15,23,42,.72);border:1px solid rgba(191,219,254,.20);border-radius:12px;padding:13px;min-height:110px;width:25%;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:5px 8px;margin-bottom:8px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(96,165,250,.18);border:1px solid rgba(191,219,254,.24);color:#bfdbfe;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;\">How to use</span><div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;margin-bottom:8px;\">Filters and time</div><ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:16px;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;\"><li>Set defaultResourceGroup</li><li>Set accountname for licenses</li><li>Widget timescales are preserved</li><li>Wire dashboard IDs after import</li></ul></td></tr></table>\n</div>"
