        "content": "<div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#111827 0%,#172554 100%);color:#ffffff;border-radius:14px;padding:18px;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px;\">Technology dashboards (OOTB)</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#dbeafe;margin-bottom:12px;\">Import from LogicMonitor Dashboards / github.com/logicmonitor/dashboards, then wire IDs. Not bundled in this portal-admin pack.</div>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:10px;\"><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:rgba(15,23,42,.76);border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.34);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;width:25%;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(96,165,250,.18);border:1px solid rgba(191,219,254,.24);color:#bfdbfe;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;\">Capacity</span><div style=\"margin-top:8px;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{OOTB_CAPACITY_ID}}\" style=\"color:#93c5fd;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\">Capacity Management</a></div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#9ca3af;margin-top:6px;\">Host / storage utilization trends</div></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:rgba(15,23,42,.76);border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.34);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;width:25%;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(96,165,250,.18);border:1px solid rgba(191,219,254,.24);color:#bfdbfe;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;\">Cloud</span><div style=\"margin-top:8px;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{OOTB_CLOUD_ID}}\" style=\"color:#93c5fd;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\">Cloud \u2014 AWS / Azure / GCP</a></div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#9ca3af;margin-top:6px;\">Cloud account and service health</div></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:rgba(15,23,42,.76);border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.34);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;width:25%;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(96,165,250,.18);border:1px solid rgba(191,219,254,.24);color:#bfdbfe;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;\">Network</span><div style=\"margin-top:8px;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{OOTB_NETWORK_ID}}\" style=\"color:#93c5fd;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\">Network Performance</a></div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#9ca3af;margin-top:6px;\">Device and path performance</div></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:rgba(15,23,42,.76);border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.34);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;width:25%;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(96,165,250,.18);border:1px solid rgba(191,219,254,.24);color:#bfdbfe;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;\">Server</span><div style=\"margin-top:8px;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{OOTB_SERVER_ID}}\" style=\"color:#93c5fd;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\">Linux / Microsoft Server</a></div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#9ca3af;margin-top:6px;\">OS performance and capacity</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:rgba(15,23,42,.76);border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.34);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;width:25%;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(96,165,250,.18);border:1px solid rgba(191,219,254,.24);color:#bfdbfe;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;\">Storage</span><div style=\"margin-top:8px;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{OOTB_STORAGE_ID}}\" style=\"color:#93c5fd;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\">Storage</a></div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#9ca3af;margin-top:6px;\">Array and datastore health</div></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:rgba(15,23,42,.76);border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.34);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;width:25%;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(96,165,250,.18);border:1px solid rgba(191,219,254,.24);color:#bfdbfe;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;\">Virt</span><div style=\"margin-top:8px;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{OOTB_VIRT_ID}}\" style=\"color:#93c5fd;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\">Virtualization</a></div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#9ca3af;margin-top:6px;\">Hypervisor and VM health</div></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:rgba(15,23,42,.76);border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.34);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;width:25%;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(96,165,250,.18);border:1px solid rgba(191,219,254,.24);color:#bfdbfe;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;\">Alerting</span><div style=\"margin-top:8px;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{OOTB_ALERTING_ID}}\" style=\"color:#93c5fd;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\">Alerting (OOTB)</a></div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#9ca3af;margin-top:6px;\">Complementary alert packs</div></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:rgba(15,23,42,.76);border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.34);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;width:25%;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(96,165,250,.18);border:1px solid rgba(191,219,254,.24);color:#bfdbfe;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;\">Websites</span><div style=\"margin-top:8px;\"><a href=\"{{PORTAL_BASE}}/uiv4/dashboard/{{OOTB_WEBSITES_ID}}\" style=\"color:#93c5fd;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;\">Websites (OOTB)</a></div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#9ca3af;margin-top:6px;\">Deep website diagnostics</div></td></tr></table>\n</div>"
